    ],
    "description": "esm-spec §9.6.4 rule 3 (Rewrite depth): a chain of 64 rules, rule r<k> rewriting op `s<k>` into a body holding `s<k+1>`. The call site fires r1 in pass 1 (depth 1); each later rule fires in pass 1 of the body of the rule before it, one level deeper. The deepest rewrite has depth 64 = MAX_REWRITE_PASSES, so the document is accepted; `y` expands to `2*u`.",
    "name": "rewrite_depth_through_bodies_64"
  },
